[Proposition prop:averse of arXiv:2603.17861, 'Gaussian concentration, integral probability metrics, and coupling functionals\\ for infin'] If $\mu\in\mathscr{M}_\tau^1(\Omega)$ satisfies either $\gcb{C,{\mathcal L}\!\!\mathrm{{\scriptscriptstyle oc}}(\Omega_{}),\ell^2}$ or
