that the conditional expectation of the diagonal overlap is given by 
\begin{equation}
\mathbb{E} \left( \mathscr{O}_{11} \ \vert \ \lambda_1 = z \right) 
= N \left( \frac{e^{(N)}(N\vert z\vert^2)}{e^{(N-1)}(N\vert z\vert^2)} - \vert z\vert^2 \right),    
\end{equation}
for any $z \in \mathbb{C}$. This expression was studied in the bulk ($|z|<1$) where it is asymptotically equivalent to $N (1-|z|^2)$.
