[Corollary cor:bernton43mod of arXiv:2506.03999, 'Large deviations for scaled families of Schr\"odinger bridges with reflection'] For any compact set $K \subseteq \calX \times \calY$, 
    \begin{equation}
        \limsup_{\eta \downarrow 0} \eta \log \pi_\eta(K) \leq -\inf_{(x,y) \in K} I(x,y).
    \end{equation}

