[Lemma estimate for gprime at wm of arXiv:2609.02073, 'Existence of closed non-planar $p$-elasticae'] Let $\gamma \in (1,2)$ and $(\lambda,C^2)\in S^0$ such that Proposition~(prop: wm around S2:2 of the paper) holds. Then 
  \begin{equation*}
    \begin{split}
      g'(w_m) = 2\left(\tfrac{p-1-\lambda}{p}-C^2 \right) + O(|\tfrac{p-1-\lambda}{p}-C^2|^\gamma) = -g'(1) + O(|\tfrac{p-1-\lambda}{p}-C^2|^\gamma).
    \end{split}
  \end{equation*}

