[Lem 40 of arXiv:2609.03821, 'Condensation and Metastability in the Supercritical Two-Species Zero-Range Process via Res'] Recall \eqref{eq:a-def}. For fixed $k\ge1$ and
$\alpha\in\mathbb{R}$, as $N\to\infty$,
\[
\sum_{\substack{p_{1},\dots,p_{k}\ge0:\\
p_{1}+\cdots+p_{k}=N
}
}\frac{1}{\mathfrak{a}(p_{1})\mathfrak{a}(p_{2})\cdots\mathfrak{a}(p_{k})}\simeq\begin{cases}
k(1+\bm{\zeta}(\alpha))^{k-1}N^{-\alpha} & \text{if}\quad\alpha>1,\\
\frac{k(\log N)^{k-1}}{N} & \text{if}\quad\alpha=1,\\
\frac{\bm{\Gamma}(1-\alpha)^{k}}{\bm{\Gamma}(k(1-\alpha))}N^{k(1-\alpha)-1} & \text{if}\quad\alpha<1.
\end{cases}
\]

