[Lemma 14 (The minimum row) of arXiv:2609.01570, 'A Proof of Fraenkel's Conjecture'] If the row at \(1\) passes, then
\begin{equation}
 R:=Q-\sum_{a\in A}a<\frac{8n}{7},
