body:
[Defn Chordal SLE($\kappa$) of arXiv:2505.14762, 'Multiple radial SLE($\kappa$) and quantum Calogero-Sutherland system'] For $\kappa \geq 0$, the chordal SLE($\kappa$) is the random Loewner chain in $\mathbb{H}$ from $0$ to $\infty$ driven by
\begin{equation}
    \xi_t =\sqrt{\kappa}B_t,
\end{equation}
where $B_t$ is the standard Brownian motion.

