[Lemma eq:U-inside of arXiv:2607.27613, 'Regularized Bulk Universality versus Bounded-Disorder Nonuniversality\\for Annealed Comple'] \label[lemma]{lem:semicircle-log-potential}
For \(\left\lverty\right\rvert\le\sqrt2\),
\begin{equation}
 U(y)=\frac{y^2}{2}-\frac12-\frac12\log2.
\end{equation}
For \(\left\lverty\right\rvert>\sqrt2\),
\begin{equation}
 U'(y)=y-\operatorname{sgn}(y)\sqrt{y^2-2}.
\end{equation}
Consequently, relative to its quadratic continuation from the edge,
\begin{equation}
 U(y)=\frac{y^2}{2}-\frac12-\frac12\log2
 -\int_{\sqrt2}^{\left\lverty\right\rvert}\sqrt{z^2-2}\,\,\mathrm d z,
 \qquad \left\lverty\right\rvert>\sqrt2.
\end{equation}

