        \item the boundary correlation functions are unchanged:
		\begin{equation}
		    \langle \vp({A}) \rangle = \langle \widetilde{\vp}(A) \rangle_{ \widetilde{G}}
            \end{equation}
            for all $A \subset W$. 
    \end{enumerate} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

