[Lem 20 of arXiv:2609.03777, '2609.03777'] Let $N,r\in\ZZ_{>0}$. For $\tau\in C$ and $\mu_1,\mu_2\in\Lambda_\tau$ with $\mu_1\ordN\mu_2$ and $\mu_1\succ\mu_2$, we have
\begin{align}
\left|G^{(N;\mu_1,\mu_2)}_{\{2\}^r}(\tau)-G^{(\infty;\mu_1,\mu_2)}_{\{2\}^r}(\tau)\right|\ll_{C,r}\LL(|\mu_1|+|\mu_2|)^{r-1}\sum_{j=1}^r\left|G^{(N;\mu_1,\mu_2)}_{2j}(\tau)-G^{(\infty;\mu_1,\mu_2)}_{2j}(\tau)\right|\,.
\end{align}

