[Lemma lem:farconnect of arXiv:2508.09291, '1+O(1) asymptotics for loop percolation in five and higher dimensions'] If $\varepsilon>0$ and $m=\left| x \right|^{1+\varepsilon}$, then as $\left| x \right|\to\infty$
    \begin{equation}
    \mathbb{P}\rk{0\longleftrightarrow x\textnormal{ but not }0\xleftrightarrow{\,\,{\subseteq B_m}\,\,}x}={\mathcal O }\rk{\left| x \right|^{(4-2d)(1+\varepsilon/4)}}=o\rk{\left| x \right|^{4-2d}}\, .
\end{equation}

