[Proposition 33 of arXiv:2511.09517, 'From Cannings model to Brownian motion conditioned on local time profile'] Assume \eqref{H1} and \eqref{eq:liminf}. Then there exists constant $c>0$ such that for any $n$ sufficiently large, $h_*+\frac{n}{(\log n)^{1+\frac{\varepsilon}{8}}}\le  s \le h^*$ and $1\le k\le q_n(s)$, we have
    \begin{equation}
    \p_n\left(X_{s-{\frac{n}{(\log n)^{1+\frac{\varepsilon}{8}}}}}\le \dfrac{k}{(\log n)^{\frac{\varepsilon}{6}}}+(\log n)^{1+\frac{\varepsilon}{2}}\,\Big|\, X_s=k\right)\ge 1-c(\log n)^{-\frac{13}{24}\varepsilon}.
    \end{equation}

