[Lemma lem.halfrelaxed of arXiv:2605.14149, 'The mean-field limit of online stochastic vector balancing'] For each $p > 4$, $\mathcal{V}_p^+$ is upper semicontinuous on $[0,1)\times {\mathcal P}_p({\mathbb R})$ and satisfies
    \begin{align*}
        \mathcal{V}_p^+(t,m) \leq \mathcal{U}_p(t,m),\qquad (t,m)\in[0,1)\times{\mathcal P}_p({\mathbb R}).
    \end{align*}

