[Proposition 7 (Pointwise finite-particle convergence to the target in KSD) of arXiv:2608.28827, 'Quantitative Target Convergence and Uniform-in-Time\\ Propagation of Chaos for Langevin-Re'] Under Assumptions~\ref{ass:core-target} and \ref{ass:ksd-kernel},
