defines a function analytic in the domain
$$
 D_{\mathcal C}:=\bigl\{ (\vv s,\vv t):  s_i \in \CC^-_{\mathcal C}, i=1,2  \mbox{ and }
t_j \in \CC^+_{\mathcal C}, j=1,2\bigr\}.
$$
This function is an analytic continuation of $F({\bf s},{ \bf t})$ defined in \eqref{def_F} into domain $D_{\mathcal C}$.
\end{itemize}

