[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2608.21905, '\bf Ruin theory incorporating MIPP-type jumps'] The Laplace transform of $\kappa_n=:\sum_{i=0}^{V_t^{(n)}}\xi_i$ is given by
\begin{equation}
\begin{split}
 \mathcal{L}_{\kappa_n}(\theta)=E[\exp\{-\theta\sum_{i=0}^{V_t^{(n)}}\xi_i\}]=(g_n^{\circ}(E[e^{-\theta\xi}]))^t.
\end{split}
\end{equation}

