[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2605.09372, 'Sharp weighted norm estimates for martingale square functions'] Let  $1<p<\infty$.  If $W\in A_p$, then
\begin{equation*}
		\left\|\mathcal T_{W,p}f\right\|_{L_p} \lesssim_{p,d}[W]_{A_p}^{\frac 1{p-1}} \|f\|_{L_p(\Omega;\mathbb C^d)},\quad\forall f\in L_p(\Omega;\mathbb C^d).
	\end{equation*}

