(see e.g. relation (13) of [BY23]), and  $A_T = \int_0^T \int_{\mathbb{R}^d} e^{-t|\xi|^2}\mu(d\xi)dt<\infty$, by Lemma (lem-add of the paper). 

Consider next the wave equation.  Note that
\begin{equation}

|\mathcal{F} G_t(\xi)|^2 =\frac{\sin^2(t|\xi|)}{|\xi|^2} \leq D_t \frac{1}{1+|\xi|^2} \quad \mbox{with $D_t=2(t^2 \vee 1)$},
\end{equation}
