[Lemma final_computation of arXiv:2607.22480, 'Distinguishability threshold for random geometric graphs'] We have \begin{align*}
    \frac{1}{2}\Var(X)-\mathbb{E}[Y]=-\!\!\!\!\!\sum_{s< i<j\leq n}\!\!\!\!\! \frac{\lambda_{si}^2\lambda_{sj}^2\lambda_{ij}^2}{2d}+ \frac{1}{d}\!\!\!\!\!\sum_{\substack{s<r\leq n\\s< i<j\leq n}}\!\!\!\!\! &\lambda_{si}\lambda_{sj}\lambda_{ri}\lambda_{rj}(1+\lambda_{sr}(z_p-\lambda_{sr}))+\widetilde O\Big( \frac{n^3p^2}{d^{3/2}} \Big).
\end{align*}

