[Theorem thm:4.3 of arXiv:2608.27474, 'Nonlocality of Cover-Time Changes Under Edge Addition'] Let \(\mathcal R_s\) be the set of distinct positive values of
\(\rho_S\) with nonzero grouped coefficient. Define
\begin{equation}
\ell_s=\sum_{\rho_S>0}\varepsilon_S\frac{B_S}{\rho_S},

\end{equation}
and
\begin{equation}
c_{s,\rho}
=
\sum_{\substack{S:\rho_S=\rho}}
\varepsilon_S\frac{A_S\rho_S-B_S}{\rho_S}.

\end{equation}
Then
\begin{equation}
\boxed{
\frac{f_s(\lambda)-f_s(0)}{\lambda}
=\ell_s+\sum_{\rho\in\mathcal R_s}
\frac{c_{s,\rho}}{1+\rho\lambda}.
}

\end{equation}
Every actual pole is simple and lies on the negative real axis.

[Lemma 230 (Estimates for difficult top-order error integrals related to integration by parts
 with respect to $\newL$) of arXiv:2609.03101, 'The emergence of the Cauchy horizon from the crease for $3D$ compressible Euler flow'] Let $N = \Ntop$, 
and let $\tanderY^N \in \mathfrak{Y}^{(N)}$, where $\mathfrak{Y}^{(N)}$
is defined in Def.\,\ref{D:STRINGSOFCOMMUTATIONVECTORFIELDS}. Let $\tanderY^{N-1} \in \mathfrak{Y}^{(N-1)}$
be such that $\tanderY^N = \Yvf{A} \tanderY^{N-1}$ for some $\Yvf{A} \in \Angularset$,
and let $\partialmodquant{\tanderY^{N-1}}$ be the corresponding partially modified quantity defined by
\eqref{E:PARTIALMODIFIEDQUANTITY}.
Then the following estimates hold for 
$(\ubar,u) \in [\leftubar,\ubarboot) \times [\moreinterestingu_1,\moreinterestingu_2]$:
	\begin{align} 
		   \begin{split} 
			 \left| \int_{ \characteristicdiamondtwoarg{[\leftubar,\ubar)}{[\moreinterestingu_1,u]}} 
			(\Yvf{A} \tanderY^N v^1) 
			(\muX v^1) 
			\newL
			\partialmodquant{\tanderY^{N-1}} \, \weight^{\blowupratetoporderwave} \voldiamond \right| 
			& \le \boxed{2.07} \weakspacetimeangularvelocitycontrol_{N}(\ubar,u) +  \Errortoparg{N}(\ubar,u),
		\end{split} \\
		  \begin{split} 
			 \left|  \sum_{i=1}^3 \int_{\ingoingcharacteristicsurfacetwoarg{\ubar}{[\moreinterestingu_1,u]}} 
			( \muX v^i )\left\{ \frac{1}{\Speed^2} (\gtorus^{-1})^{AB} \gtorusdoublenullCOV_B^C \nullgeop{x^C} \tanderY^N  v^i \right\}  \,\partialmodquant{\tanderY^{N-1}} \, \weight^{\blowupratetoporderwave}
			\, \volingoingnullhypersurface \right| 
