	By the (inhomogeneous) CLT, see for example~\cite[Chapter V, Theorem 3]{Petrov-1995}, that quantity is less than \(1-\frac{1}{2}P(\calN(0,1) \geq cK)< 1\) for some ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:1bf31ca8e016d6c15c2d1673aafdac22e2dab42596484738ae2c86d80c27c723","revision_digest":"sha256:e593a3349110966084f2a59440d8a95d6aa08c72140372f871f1b572b8040580","source_id":"arxiv:2511.09280","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-07","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

