body:
[Lemma eq:ergolgamma of arXiv:2505.12187, 'Speeding up quantum Markov processes through lifting'] Let $\mathcal{L}_\gamma$ be a QMS generator of the form (equation eq:decom of the paper) satisfying Conditions~(asspA of the paper) and~(assump:PHP of the paper). Then the semigroup $\exp(t \mathcal{L}_\gamma)$ is ergodic: 
    \begin{align} 
        \lim_{t \to \infty} \exp(t \mathcal{L}_\gamma) = E_{\mathcal{F}}\,,
    \end{align}
    where $E_{\mathcal{F}}$ is the conditional expectation onto $\mathcal{F}(\mathcal{L}_\gamma)$.

