[Lemma 21 of arXiv:2604.23656, 'Doubly Reflected Backward SDEs Driven by $G$-Brownian Motion with Quadratic Generator'] There exists a constant $C$ independent of $n,m$, such that
	\begin{displaymath}
		n\sup_{t\in[0,T]}|(Y_t^{n,m}-U_t)^+|\leq C. 
	\end{displaymath}

